<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Loom Rush · Nouns Edition</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Ten waves on the road to the Living Hearth. Place towers, then send the wave. Sound starts off." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#14110f" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://pointcast.xyz/sketches/loom-rush/" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <p class="kicker">LR-1 · Seed 1126</p>
        <h1>Loom Rush</h1>
        <p>Nouns Edition. Ten waves on the coastal road to the Living Hearth. Pads are numbered 0 through 5, spawn to hearth. The Signing Desk Paladin unlocks at wave 6.</p>
      </header>
      <div id="board"></div>
      <footer>
        <p>Six 32×32 sprites are the CC0 Nouns posted on #loom-rush, messages m_690b3z3n58 through m_4k2h6h1v31: noun knight, silo dragon, collator scout, signing paladin, night raider, and gong bombard. They are stored with this page and drawn at 1× on the 390-wide board, nearest neighbour. Archer and mage marks are drawn here.</p>
        <p>Sound is off until you turn it on. If you prefer reduced motion, the board skips the march and shows the wave result.</p>
      </footer>
      <noscript><p>This sketch plays in the browser. JavaScript draws the road.</p></noscript>
    </main>
    <script>
      import { mountLoomRush } from '../../lib/loom/loom-rush-view.mjs';
      const board = document.getElementById('board');
      if (board) mountLoomRush(board, window);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark;
    color: #f4ede4;
    background: #14110f;
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  main {
    width: min(100%, 840px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 16px calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  }
  header { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .kicker { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #e0b15a; font: 12px/1.4 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 560; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  p { margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.45; }
  footer { margin-top: 22px; color: #cbbba8; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  #field {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 780px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    background: #d5e4ea;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    image-rendering: crisp-edges;
    touch-action: manipulation;
  }
  #status { min-height: 1.4em; margin: 12px 0; }
  .proof { font: 12px/1.5 ui-monospace, monospace; color: #e0b15a; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .seed-row, .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin: 8px 0; }
  .towers, .pads { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin: 8px 0; }
  .towers { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .pads { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  label { font-size: 0.95rem; }
  input, button {
    min-height: 44px;
    font: inherit;
    color: #f4ede4;
    background: #241c16;
    border: 1px solid #8d7358;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  input { width: 8rem; padding: 0 10px; }
  button { padding: 8px 12px; touch-action: manipulation; }
  button.primary { background: #9a3412; border-color: #e07040; }
  button[aria-pressed="true"], button[aria-current="true"] { outline: 2px solid #e0b15a; outline-offset: 2px; }
  button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #e0b15a; outline-offset: 2px; }
  .towers button, .pads button { width: 100%; }
  #log, #standings { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  #log li, #standings li { margin: 4px 0; }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .towers { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .pads { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 390px) {
    main { padding: 12px 12px calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
    h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, *::before, *::after {
      animation: none !important;
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
